(text "E16: E15 DC inlet/eFuse + independent TLV7011 fast OV shutdown. Auxiliary supply powers comparison and PGOOD guard; no MCU or main-rail dependency." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid c1001b68-30ac-570b-b954-728536736ee5))
(text "Conditional schematic prototype. No IEC surge claim, PCB/enclosure placement or physical startup/fault validation. Final analog/digital rail OV disconnects remain open." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d64f6319-53f9-556d-97cc-ced6c111d3ac))
(text "FAST_OV_OUT high -> Q3 grounds POWER_RUN/SHDN. R17 provides hysteresis. Local wiring, comparator delay/drive and transferred fault charge require qualification." (at 20.32 425.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f9035a73-d5f2-528f-b68c-9a36a9a57e35))
(text "Auxiliary PG/C10 holds SHDN low during startup. S1 missing -> OFF via47k. AUX starts through external FET body diode before the internal pass FET." (at 20.32 434.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e1b03236-d5ed-5bb3-9ede-8d59eb46bf38))
(text "TVS standoff33V permits24V DC misplug. Fuse/TVS coordination, transient clamp voltage and final rail disconnects remain open; no physical protection approval." (at 20.32 443.23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid b68d7bb1-61d4-5406-b352-4c9b6d2a47e7))
